data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Utilities not helpful. We can use inline styles with tokens. The design says \"No custom CSS should be needed beyond the design-system utilities and component classes; if inline layout is required, use the spacing tokens above.\" It doesn't forbid inline layout, just no custom CSS file. So inline style ok.\n\nNeed center card vertically and horizontally in page content area. Page is flex column, flex 1. We can put a div style={{ flex: 1, display: \"flex\", alignItems: \"center\", justifyContent: \"center\" }} between Page and Card. That uses inline style with flex. Is that allowed? It says if inline layout is required, use the spacing tokens above. It mentions spacing tokens, not flex. But no custom CSS beyond design-system... Using inline style for layout is custom CSS technically, but maybe acceptable. However, maybe Page with width readable centers horizontally? Page centering uses padding not centering a box. Card will be width 100% of main. To center card horizontally, maybe Card has no max-width. Could set margin: \"0 auto\" on Card? But Card display flex column and Page full width. Could use inline style display: \"flex\", flexDirection: \"column\", alignItems: \"center\", justifyContent: \"center\" on Page? But Page is already display flex column. Adding alignItems center centers children horizontally. Then for vertical center, Page is flex:1 but alignItems center doesn't vertical center in column unless justifyContent center. We can't change Page's justifyContent. So wrapper is needed. We'll add a \u003cdiv style={{ flex: 1, display: \"flex\", flexDirection: \"column\", alignItems: \"center\", justifyContent: \"center\" }}\u003e. That is fine.\n\nCard padding should be var(--space-6). Does Card default padding var(--space-4) for variant default. We can add className or style padding var(--space-6). The design says comfortable padding var(--space-6). Card's .cs-component-card-10 (default?) maybe padding space-4. We need set padding var(--space-6). Use style padding: \"var(--space-6)\". Good.\n\nGreeting inside card. Need marginBottom var(--space-4) between greeting and button row. Button row gap var(--space-2). Good.\n\nFooter text centered: component has text-align center. We passed style textAlign center and children. Footer prop children. Good.\n\nHeader title. Good.\n\nNow check build. Run npm run build. Need ensure imports work. Use React 19. Button uses children as ReactNode. Good.\n\nPotential issue: @codesweep-ai/ui peer deps react ^18.3 || ^19, ok. It has dependency react-markdown etc but ok.\n\nRun build."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959020,"id":"chatcmpl-8b84fcd355dc456d815a43d2338b721b","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

